{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "COL",
  "chapter": 3,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "COL.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "If ye then be raised with Christ, seek those things which are above, where Christ sitteth on the right hand of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Set your affection on things above, not on things on the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye are dead, and your life is hid with Christ in God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When Christ, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our life, shall appear, then will ye also appear with him in glory.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Mortify therefore your members which are upon the earth; lewdness, uncleanness, inordinate affection, evil concupiscence, and covetousness, which is idolatry:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For which things the wrath of God cometh on the children of disobedience:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "In which ye also walked formerly, when ye lived with them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But now ye also put off all these; anger, wrath, malice, blasphemy, filthy communication out of your mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lie not one to another, seeing ye have put off the old man with his deeds;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And have put on the new ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", which is renewed in knowledge after the image of him that created him:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where there is neither Greek nor Jew, circumcision nor uncircumcision, Barbarian, Scythian, bond ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "nor",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " free: but Christ ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all, and in all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Put on therefore, as the elect of God, holy and beloved, bowels of mercies, kindness, humbleness of mind, meekness, long-suffering;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Forbearing one another, and forgiving one another, if any man hath a quarrel against any: even as Christ forgave you, so also ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "do",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And above all these things ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "put on",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " charity, which is the bond of perfectness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And let the peace of God rule in your hearts, to which also ye are called in one body; and be ye thankful.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let the word of Christ dwell in you richly in all wisdom; teaching and admonishing one another in psalms, and hymns, and spiritual songs, singing with grace in your hearts to the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whatever ye do in word or deed, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "do",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all in the name of the Lord Jesus, giving thanks to God and the Father by him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wives, submit yourselves to your own husbands, as it is fit in the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Husbands, love ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " wives, and be not bitter against them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Children, obey ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " parents in all things: for this is well-pleasing to the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Fathers, provoke not your children ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to anger",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", lest they be discouraged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Servants, obey in all things ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "your",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " masters according to the flesh; not with eye-service, as men-pleasers; but in singleness of heart, fearing God:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whatever ye do, do ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " heartily, as to the Lord, and not to men;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Knowing that from the Lord ye will receive the reward of the inheritance: for ye serve the Lord Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "COL.3.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:COL.3.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But he that doeth wrong, will receive for the wrong which he hath done: and there is no respect of persons.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
